          "PHASE 2: DATA CLEANING & FEATURE ENGINEERING\n============================================================\n\nStep 1: Imputation\n  Age: Fill with median (28.4)\n  Embarked: Fill with mode (S)\n\nStep 2: Feature Engineering\n  FamilySize = SibSp + Parch + 1\n  IsAlone = 1 if FamilySize == 1\n  FarePerPerson = Fare / FamilySize\n  AgeBin = binned age (0-4)\n  IsChild = 1 if Age < 15\n  HighFare = 1 if Fare > 75th percentile\n\nStep 3: Encoding\n  Sex \u2192 Sex_encoded (female=1, male=0)\n  Embarked \u2192 Embarked_Q, Embarked_S (one-hot, drop first)\n\nFinal feature set (14 features):\n  ['Pclass', 'Age', 'SibSp', 'Parch', 'Fare', 'FamilySize', 'IsAlone', 'FarePerPerson', 'AgeBin', 'IsChild', 'HighFare', 'Sex_encoded', 'Embarked_Q', 'Embarked_S']\n\nShape: (891, 14)\nMissing values: 0"
